even say it'll be all right.

258
00:11:08,081 --> 00:11:08,920
- Yeah, yeah.

259
00:11:08,921 --> 00:11:09,760
- It'll be all right.

260
00:11:09,761 --> 00:11:10,700
- Yeah.

261
00:11:10,724 --> 00:11:12,680
- These are three really helpful phrases

262
00:11:12,681 --> 00:11:15,280
that you can use when you
want to say something nice

263
00:11:15,281 --> 00:11:18,440
to a friend or a colleague
who has a problem.

264
00:11:18,441 --> 00:11:20,680
- Okay, exactly very useful language.

265
00:11:20,681 --> 00:11:23,400
So let's listen to some more examples.

